---
import { contact } from "@/lib/site";
---

<section id="localizacao" class="cvg-section bg-cvg-background">
  <div class="cvg-shell grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:items-stretch">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-cvg-primary">Localizacao</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-cvg-text">Estamos na Avenida Guarapiranga</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-cvg-muted">
        Endereco textual permanece visivel mesmo se o mapa externo nao carregar.
      </p>
      <address class="mt-5 rounded-lg border border-cvg-border bg-white p-5 not-italic text-cvg-muted">
        {contact.name}<br />
        {contact.addressSummary}<br />
        {contact.region}
      </address>
      <a href={contact.mapsHref} class="cvg-button cvg-button-secondary mt-5">Ver como chegar</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid min-h-[320px] place-items-center rounded-lg border border-cvg-border bg-white p-6 text-center text-cvg-muted shadow-sm">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xl font-bold text-cvg-text">Mapa configuravel</p>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md">Inserir iframe ou link oficial aprovado sem credenciais privadas no codigo-fonte.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
